# Per-slice telemetry appended by `--cycle`/`--execute` on this repo. Tracking it wedges the
# nightly: the cycle writes rows, nothing commits them, and the next preflight aborts on a
# dirty tree. afk-agent-system ignores its own for the same reason; afk-cockpit reads the
# working-tree file, not git, so ignoring it costs the dashboard nothing.
docs/dev-cycle/telemetry.jsonl
